      "pali": "yo phoṭṭhabbesu … ",
      "english": "touches, "
    },
    {
      "number": 10,
      "pali": "yo dhammesu chandarāgo, cittasseso upakkileso. ",
      "english": "or ideas is a corruption of the mind. "
    },
    {
      "number": 11,
      "pali": "Yato kho, bhikkhave, bhikkhuno imesu chasu ṭhānesu cetaso upakkileso pahīno hoti, nekkhammaninnañcassa cittaṁ hoti. ",
      "english": "When a mendicant has given up mental corruption in these six cases, their mind inclines to renunciation. "
    },
    {
      "number": 12,
      "pali": "Nekkhammaparibhāvitaṁ cittaṁ kammaniyaṁ khāyati, abhiññā sacchikaraṇīyesu dhammesū”ti. ",
      "english": "A mind imbued with renunciation is said to be fit for work regarding anything that can be realized by insight.” "
    },
